      <h3>Acknowledging the City of Moreton Bay</h3>
      <p>Early in 2026, Lifepoint Church received a community support grant that allowed two young women from our Youth to attend Stage One of the Girls’ Brigade Queensland Leadership Development Course. They attended from 20 to 27 September at Somerset Dam and both have since spoken about how much they gained from it, with plans to complete Stage Two in 2027.</p>
      <p><strong>We’re grateful to the City of Moreton Bay for their generosity in supporting youth leadership in our community.</strong></p>
